{"seq":2,"slug":"planet-formation-models","title":"行星形成模型：从尘埃到行星","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/solar-system-formation/planet-formation-models","wordCount":2057,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"行星形成模型-从尘埃到行星\">行星形成模型：从尘埃到行星</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>行星形成是将微米级星际尘埃转化为数千公里级行星体的跨越十个数量级的增长过程。当前主要存在两大理论框架：核吸积模型（Core Accretion）和引力不稳定性模型（Gravitational Instability），它们分别适用于不同的行星形成环境。太阳系行星的多样性——从水星到木星——要求一个综合的动力学演化图景来解释最终的轨道构型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>行星形成理论的核心在于跨越十个数量级的增长如何越过若干瓶颈，各概念分别回答其中一个环节：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>对应本文</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>米级障碍</td>\n<td>分米–米级颗粒因弹跳、碎裂和径向漂移而停止增长</td>\n<td>早期增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流体不稳定性</td>\n<td>固体/气体比超过临界值时颗粒集体聚集，直接坍缩成 ~100 km 星子</td>\n<td>星子形成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核吸积模型</td>\n<td>星子→胚胎→临界核质量→失控气体吸积，解释太阳系巨行星</td>\n<td>核吸积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失控气体吸积</td>\n<td>核达到 5–15 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后包层失稳，快速吸积大量气体</td>\n<td>临界核质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卵石吸积</td>\n<td>mm–cm 卵石受气动阻力被高效捕获，把核形成时标压缩进盘寿命</td>\n<td>卵石吸积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引力不稳定性</td>\n<td>Toomre 判据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时盘自引力碎裂直接成星</td>\n<td>引力不稳定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>巨碰撞</td>\n<td>行星胚胎轨道交叉后的撞击，组装类地行星并形成月球</td>\n<td>巨碰撞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nice / Grand Tack</td>\n<td>巨行星轨道迁移与重组模型，解释外太阳系构型与内盘清扫</td>\n<td>动力学演化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从尘埃到星子-早期增长\">从尘埃到星子：早期增长</h2><h3 id=\"尘埃颗粒增长\">尘埃颗粒增长</h3><p>微米级星际尘埃通过布朗运动碰撞和差异沉降开始黏合增长：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>增长阶段</th>\n<th>尺寸范围</th>\n<th>主导机制</th>\n<th>时间尺度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>布朗运动碰撞</td>\n<td>μm → mm</td>\n<td>范德瓦尔斯力黏合</td>\n<td>~10³ yr</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差异沉降</td>\n<td>mm → cm</td>\n<td>盘中面沉降 + 碰撞</td>\n<td>~10⁴ yr</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漂移碰撞</td>\n<td>cm → m</td>\n<td>径向漂移差异</td>\n<td>~10⁴ yr</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"米级障碍\">米级障碍</h3><p>当颗粒增长到分米至米级时，面临三重障碍：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[米级障碍] --&gt; B[弹跳障碍]&#10;    A --&gt; C[碎裂障碍]&#10;    A --&gt; D[径向漂移障碍]&#10;    B --&gt; E[cm级颗粒碰撞仅弹跳不黏合]&#10;    C --&gt; F[高速碰撞导致碎裂而非增长]&#10;    D --&gt; G[米级颗粒快速漂移落入恒星]&#10;    G --&gt; H[漂移时标 ~100 yr at 1 AU]&#10;    E --&gt; I[突破机制]&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    D --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[流体不稳定性聚集]&#10;    I --&gt; K[冰颗粒特殊黏性]&#10;    I --&gt; L[压力陷阱捕获]\">flowchart TD\n    A[米级障碍] --&gt; B[弹跳障碍]\n    A --&gt; C[碎裂障碍]\n    A --&gt; D[径向漂移障碍]\n    B --&gt; E[cm级颗粒碰撞仅弹跳不黏合]\n    C --&gt; F[高速碰撞导致碎裂而非增长]\n    D --&gt; G[米级颗粒快速漂移落入恒星]\n    G --&gt; H[漂移时标 ~100 yr at 1 AU]\n    E --&gt; I[突破机制]\n    F --&gt; I\n    D --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[流体不稳定性聚集]\n    I --&gt; K[冰颗粒特殊黏性]\n    I --&gt; L[压力陷阱捕获]</pre><h3 id=\"星子形成的突破\">星子形成的突破</h3><p>绕过米级障碍的主要理论：</p>\n<p><strong>流体不稳定性（Streaming Instability）</strong>：当固体与气体的质量比超过临界值时，颗粒-气体耦合的集体效应导致颗粒局部聚集，密度增强可达100倍以上，随后通过引力坍缩直接形成 ~100 km 级星子。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.02</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\rho_p}{\\rho_g} &gt; Z_{crit} \\approx 0.01 - 0.02</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0797em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>流体不稳定性的关键预言：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>星子直径 ~100 km 为优势尺寸（与小行星带观测一致）</li>\n<li>星子一诞生就是&quot;大&quot;的，跳过km级慢增长</li>\n<li>形成时间尺度 ~数个轨道周期</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核吸积模型\">核吸积模型</h2><h3 id=\"基本框架\">基本框架</h3><p>核吸积（Core Accretion）是解释太阳系巨行星形成的标准模型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[星子形成 ~100 km] --&gt; B[寡头增长]&#10;    B --&gt; C[行星胚胎 ~月球质量]&#10;    C --&gt; D{位置在雪线外?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[快速核增长]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[类地行星胚胎]&#10;    E --&gt; G[达到临界核质量 ~10 M⊕]&#10;    G --&gt; H[失控气体吸积]&#10;    H --&gt; I[气态巨行星 Jupiter/Saturn]&#10;    F --&gt; J[巨碰撞阶段]&#10;    J --&gt; K[类地行星 Mercury-Mars]&#10;    E --&gt; L[未达临界质量]&#10;    L --&gt; M[冰巨行星 Uranus/Neptune]\">flowchart TD\n    A[星子形成 ~100 km] --&gt; B[寡头增长]\n    B --&gt; C[行星胚胎 ~月球质量]\n    C --&gt; D{位置在雪线外?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[快速核增长]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[类地行星胚胎]\n    E --&gt; G[达到临界核质量 ~10 M⊕]\n    G --&gt; H[失控气体吸积]\n    H --&gt; I[气态巨行星 Jupiter/Saturn]\n    F --&gt; J[巨碰撞阶段]\n    J --&gt; K[类地行星 Mercury-Mars]\n    E --&gt; L[未达临界质量]\n    L --&gt; M[冰巨行星 Uranus/Neptune]</pre><h3 id=\"寡头增长阶段\">寡头增长阶段</h3><p>当最大星子的引力聚焦增强足够显著时，少数&quot;寡头&quot;支配局部吸积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dM}{dt} = \\pi R_{eff}^2 \\Sigma_s \\Omega F_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2472em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{eff}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为有效捕获半径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_g = 1 + (v_{esc}/v_\\infty)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">esc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为引力聚焦因子。</p>\n<p>寡头增长特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>寡头间距 ~10 Hill 半径</li>\n<li>每个寡头支配其&quot;食物区&quot;</li>\n<li>增长速率随质量增加而加速</li>\n<li>最终产生几十到数百个行星胚胎</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"临界核质量与失控气体吸积\">临界核质量与失控气体吸积</h3><p>当固体核质量达到临界值时，包层无法维持流体静力平衡，触发失控气体吸积：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>影响因素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>临界核质量</td>\n<td>5–15 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>不透明度、吸积率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气体吸积时标</td>\n<td>~10⁵ yr</td>\n<td>盘粘滞供给率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终质量</td>\n<td>~Jupiter</td>\n<td>缝开 → 供给终止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kelvin-Helmholtz 收缩</td>\n<td>~10⁶ yr</td>\n<td>包层冷却速率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"核吸积的时间尺度问题\">核吸积的时间尺度问题</h3><p>经典核吸积在木星轨道处的核形成需要 &gt;10 Myr，与盘寿命矛盾。现代解决方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>卵石吸积（Pebble Accretion）</strong>：mm-cm级卵石因气动阻力被行星引力高效捕获，核增长加速10–1000倍</li>\n<li><strong>行星迁移辅助</strong>：核在内迁移过程中扫过更多固体</li>\n<li><strong>早期形成</strong>：最新陨石同位素证据显示木星核在太阳系诞生后 &lt;1 Myr 即开始形成</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"引力不稳定性模型\">引力不稳定性模型</h2><h3 id=\"基本原理\">基本原理</h3><p>当盘足够冷且致密时，可满足 Toomre 不稳定性判据：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\frac{c_s \\Omega}{\\pi G \\Sigma} &lt; Q_{crit} \\approx 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>此时盘自引力超过热压力和科里奥利力的稳定作用，发生碎裂直接形成巨行星。</p>\n<h3 id=\"适用条件与限制\">适用条件与限制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间尺度极短（~10³ yr）</td>\n<td>需要异常致密/冷的盘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释宽轨道巨行星</td>\n<td>内盘温度过高难以碎裂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可自然形成多行星系统</td>\n<td>预言的行星质量偏大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对恒星金属丰度不敏感</td>\n<td>难以解释核-包层分层结构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"两模型的互补性\">两模型的互补性</h3><p>当前共识：核吸积解释太阳系巨行星（&lt;10 AU）和大多数已知系外行星；引力不稳定性可能适用于少数宽轨道直接成像行星（&gt;50 AU）和早期盘碎裂场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"巨碰撞与类地行星形成\">巨碰撞与类地行星形成</h2><h3 id=\"晚期巨碰撞阶段\">晚期巨碰撞阶段</h3><p>行星胚胎间的引力扰动最终导致轨道交叉和巨碰撞：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>时间（太阳系年龄后）</th>\n<th>证据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>月球形成撞击</td>\n<td>~50–100 Myr</td>\n<td>Hf-W同位素定年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类地行星最终组装</td>\n<td>30–150 Myr</td>\n<td>N体模拟 + 陨石年代学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>晚期重轰炸</td>\n<td>~3.9 Gyr前</td>\n<td>月球撞击坑年代学（存争议）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"月球形成的巨碰撞假说\">月球形成的巨碰撞假说</h3><p>一个火星大小的天体（Theia）与原始地球的斜碰撞产生了月球：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>碰撞角度 ~45°</li>\n<li>碰撞速度 ~4 km/s</li>\n<li>产生的碎片盘凝聚成月球</li>\n<li>解释月球贫铁、地-月氧同位素相似性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"动力学演化模型\">动力学演化模型</h2><h3 id=\"nice-模型\">Nice 模型</h3><p>Nice 模型（2005）解释太阳系晚期动力学重组：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[初始构型: 巨行星紧凑排列] --&gt; B[木星-土星穿越 2:1 共振]&#10;    B --&gt; C[轨道不稳定性触发]&#10;    C --&gt; D[天王星/海王星向外散射]&#10;    C --&gt; E[木星略向内迁移]&#10;    C --&gt; F[柯伊伯带被扰动]&#10;    D --&gt; G[解释天王星/海王星当前位置]&#10;    E --&gt; H[解释小行星带动力学激发]&#10;    F --&gt; I[解释冥王星族轨道分布]&#10;    C --&gt; J[晚期重轰炸?]\">flowchart TD\n    A[初始构型: 巨行星紧凑排列] --&gt; B[木星-土星穿越 2:1 共振]\n    B --&gt; C[轨道不稳定性触发]\n    C --&gt; D[天王星/海王星向外散射]\n    C --&gt; E[木星略向内迁移]\n    C --&gt; F[柯伊伯带被扰动]\n    D --&gt; G[解释天王星/海王星当前位置]\n    E --&gt; H[解释小行星带动力学激发]\n    F --&gt; I[解释冥王星族轨道分布]\n    C --&gt; J[晚期重轰炸?]</pre><h3 id=\"grand-tack-模型\">Grand Tack 模型</h3><p>Grand Tack 模型（2011）描述木星早期的先内后外迁移：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>木星位置</th>\n<th>物理机制</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>形成</td>\n<td>~3.5 AU</td>\n<td>核吸积</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内迁移（Type II）</td>\n<td>3.5 → 1.5 AU</td>\n<td>盘-行星相互作用</td>\n<td>清扫内太阳系物质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转折点</td>\n<td>1.5 AU</td>\n<td>土星追上，共享共振</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外迁移</td>\n<td>1.5 → 5.2 AU</td>\n<td>2:3共振锁定外迁</td>\n<td>重新注入物质</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Grand Tack 解释：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>火星质量为何偏小（内盘被清扫）</li>\n<li>小行星带的质量亏损</li>\n<li>C型/S型小行星的混合分布</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"早期不稳定性模型\">早期不稳定性模型</h3><p>最新演化（2018-2025）趋向&quot;早期不稳定性&quot;：巨行星重组发生在盘耗散后的数百万年内（而非Nice模型的数亿年后），更好地解释陨石证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卵石吸积-现代核吸积的关键补充\">卵石吸积：现代核吸积的关键补充</h2><h3 id=\"卵石吸积机制\">卵石吸积机制</h3><p>mm-cm级&quot;卵石&quot;在气动阻力作用下被行星引力高效捕获：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>M</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{M}_{pebble} \\approx 2 \\left(\\frac{St}{0.1}\\right)^{2/3} r_H v_H \\Sigma_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2063em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bb</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6779em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7279em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2/3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">St</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为 Stokes 数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 Hill 半径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与经典星子吸积的对比\">与经典星子吸积的对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>星子吸积</th>\n<th>卵石吸积</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>捕获截面</td>\n<td>引力聚焦 ~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_H^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0894em;vertical-align:-0.2753em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4247em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2753em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>气动辅助 ~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_H \\cdot r_{Bondi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增长时标 (5 AU)</td>\n<td>&gt;10 Myr</td>\n<td>~0.1–1 Myr</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固体源</td>\n<td>本地星子</td>\n<td>外盘漂移卵石流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终止条件</td>\n<td>食物区耗尽</td>\n<td>卵石隔离质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用范围</td>\n<td>内太阳系</td>\n<td>全盘有效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>卵石吸积解决了核吸积的时标问题，使木星核在 &lt;3 Myr（盘寿命内）形成成为可能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"太阳系形成时间线综合\">太阳系形成时间线综合</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[0 Myr: 盘形成] --&gt; B[0.5: 木星核开始]&#10;    B --&gt; C[1-2: 木星失控气体吸积]&#10;    C --&gt; D[2-3: 土星形成]&#10;    D --&gt; E[3-5: 盘耗散]&#10;    E --&gt; F[5-10: 巨行星不稳定性]&#10;    F --&gt; G[30-100: 类地行星巨碰撞]&#10;    G --&gt; H[~50: 月球形成]\">flowchart LR\n    A[0 Myr: 盘形成] --&gt; B[0.5: 木星核开始]\n    B --&gt; C[1-2: 木星失控气体吸积]\n    C --&gt; D[2-3: 土星形成]\n    D --&gt; E[3-5: 盘耗散]\n    E --&gt; F[5-10: 巨行星不稳定性]\n    F --&gt; G[30-100: 类地行星巨碰撞]\n    G --&gt; H[~50: 月球形成]</pre><h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>行星形成理论正经历从经典两步模型（星子 → 行星）向多尺度、多机制耦合框架的转变。流体不稳定性解决了km级增长障碍；卵石吸积克服了核形成的时标瓶颈；动力学模型（Nice、Grand Tack）揭示了行星系统经历剧烈重组后才达到当前构型。ALMA对年轻盘中行星形成痕迹的直接观测，正在实时验证这些理论预言。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"行星形成模型：从尘埃到行星","id":"行星形成模型-从尘埃到行星"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从尘埃到星子：早期增长","id":"从尘埃到星子-早期增长"},{"level":3,"text":"尘埃颗粒增长","id":"尘埃颗粒增长"},{"level":3,"text":"米级障碍","id":"米级障碍"},{"level":3,"text":"星子形成的突破","id":"星子形成的突破"},{"level":2,"text":"核吸积模型","id":"核吸积模型"},{"level":3,"text":"基本框架","id":"基本框架"},{"level":3,"text":"寡头增长阶段","id":"寡头增长阶段"},{"level":3,"text":"临界核质量与失控气体吸积","id":"临界核质量与失控气体吸积"},{"level":3,"text":"核吸积的时间尺度问题","id":"核吸积的时间尺度问题"},{"level":2,"text":"引力不稳定性模型","id":"引力不稳定性模型"},{"level":3,"text":"基本原理","id":"基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"适用条件与限制","id":"适用条件与限制"},{"level":3,"text":"两模型的互补性","id":"两模型的互补性"},{"level":2,"text":"巨碰撞与类地行星形成","id":"巨碰撞与类地行星形成"},{"level":3,"text":"晚期巨碰撞阶段","id":"晚期巨碰撞阶段"},{"level":3,"text":"月球形成的巨碰撞假说","id":"月球形成的巨碰撞假说"},{"level":2,"text":"动力学演化模型","id":"动力学演化模型"},{"level":3,"text":"Nice 模型","id":"nice-模型"},{"level":3,"text":"Grand Tack 模型","id":"grand-tack-模型"},{"level":3,"text":"早期不稳定性模型","id":"早期不稳定性模型"},{"level":2,"text":"卵石吸积：现代核吸积的关键补充","id":"卵石吸积-现代核吸积的关键补充"},{"level":3,"text":"卵石吸积机制","id":"卵石吸积机制"},{"level":3,"text":"与经典星子吸积的对比","id":"与经典星子吸积的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"太阳系形成时间线综合","id":"太阳系形成时间线综合"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"原行星盘：太阳系的诞生摇篮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/solar-system-formation/protoplanetary-disk"},"next":{"title":"小天体与陨石：太阳系的化石记录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/solar-system-formation/small-bodies-meteorites"}}